Installation, maintenance and continuing thermal performance (@th-continued-service: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer, #source "../sources/A-Heat-Transfer-Textbook-Lienhard.lingua#r_7TKQ2D5YRNQ8XVHXNJQDRANWKD", #source "../sources/Heat-Pipe-Design-Handbook-Brennan-Kroliczek.lingua#r_08JYCA7B2K6B8E5490DSJYQJFA", #source "../sources/Guarded-Hot-Plate-and-SRM-1450e-NIST.lingua#r_1PP28H0Y6N7RVY89W9HSQY18E4", #thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer "../study/Derive-and-check-a-combined-transport-model.lingua#r_77N3EXRST6J39D13QJ83RDY9VJ") { r_6P3MDPMFQPNNZFDECV0BCDR6SD
**Read:** [A Heat Transfer Textbook — Lienhard and Lienhard](../sources/A-Heat-Transfer-Textbook-Lienhard.lingua#r_7TKQ2D5YRNQ8XVHXNJQDRANWKD), complete relevant equipment models; [Heat Pipe Design Handbook, Volume I — Brennan and Kroliczek](../sources/Heat-Pipe-Design-Handbook-Brennan-Kroliczek.lingua#r_08JYCA7B2K6B8E5490DSJYQJFA), design limitations and testing context; [Guarded-hot-plate evidence — NIST SP 260-201](../sources/Guarded-Hot-Plate-and-SRM-1450e-NIST.lingua#r_1PP28H0Y6N7RVY89W9HSQY18E4), conditioning, repeatability and measurement evidence.

A delivered thermal system depends on actual materials, assembly, utilities, instrumentation and people. Specify the intended duty, environmental conditions, interfaces and measurable acceptance criteria. Preserve the physical configuration used to support a performance claim.

Plan how to inspect and recognize changed contact, fouling, insulation damage, degraded flow, leakage, sensor drift and altered load. Compare performance at consistent conditions or use a justified normalization. Record repairs, substitutions and operating history, then repeat the measurements most sensitive to the changed mechanism.

Relate the service to [Electrical power engineering — sources, networks, machines and continuing service](../../../engineering/electrical-power-engineering/Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ), [Mining and mineral engineering — extraction, processing, and continuing work](../../../engineering/mining-and-mineral-engineering/Mining-and-mineral-engineering.lingua#r_22HJPS3RTK5EX1J55YJP75PHYA), [Metals and metallurgical production — feed, refining, structure, useful products, and recovery](../../../../ergon/materials/metals-and-metallurgical-production/Metals-and-metallurgical-production.lingua#r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1) and [Industrial chemistry — chemical transformations, useful products and continuing production](../../../chemistry/industrial-chemistry/Industrial-chemistry.lingua#r_3AKBAFB2ABJ0671QW6ZBQ0B618) where those systems supply energy, materials or process demand. A thermal calculation supplies only part of their engineering. Practical evidence includes commissioning, measured operation, a response to a real or safely simulated disruption, and a revised account of the restored system.

**Continue:** [Derive and check a combined transport model](../study/Derive-and-check-a-combined-transport-model.lingua#r_77N3EXRST6J39D13QJ83RDY9VJ).

